Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:03.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Let me ask a presidential question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:03.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}大統領っぽい質問をさせてくれ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.11,0:00:07.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Let's just say in one future,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.11,0:00:07.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}you're running for president, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.11,0:00:07.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}もしもの話　あんたが大統領選に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.11,0:00:07.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}出るとするだろ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.17,0:00:12.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And we're still in the quagmire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.17,0:00:12.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}that is the Ukraine war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.17,0:00:12.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}で、ウクライナ戦争の泥沼が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.17,0:00:12.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}まだ続いてる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.27,0:00:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I made y'all see the 2024.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.27,0:00:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}2024を見せただろ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:17.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But he's talking. What do you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:17.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}まだ話してるだろ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.03,0:00:25.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}what would a President Ye do to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.03,0:00:25.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}avoid what might be World War III?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.03,0:00:25.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}大統領Yeなら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.03,0:00:25.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}第三次世界大戦を避けるために　何をする？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:27.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I'm ending all wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:27.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}全ての戦争を終わらせる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:28.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:28.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}どうやって？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.19,0:00:30.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}2024. We ended all wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.19,0:00:30.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}2024年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.19,0:00:30.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺たちは全ての戦争を終わらせた
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.11,0:00:31.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Because wars...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.11,0:00:31.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}でも戦争は…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:34.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}but how do you end wars?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:34.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Don't just say end wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:34.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}どうやって終わらせる？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:34.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}「終わらせる」だけじゃなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:35.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You got to, you got to have real...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:35.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}ちゃんとした中身がないと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:40.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Because war is made
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:40.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}off of greed and deceit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:40.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}戦争は　欲と嘘で　できてるからな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.33,0:00:41.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And economy as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.33,0:00:41.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}経済もな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:45.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Economy. But there is a free
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:45.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}economy that the world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:45.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}経済もだ　でも世界が作った　自由な経済を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}has created for us that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}needs to be simplified by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:50.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺がシンプルにする必要がある
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.51,0:00:52.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I am the visionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.51,0:00:52.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}俺はビジョナリーだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:00:57.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I can end war. I can end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:00:57.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}war. We can end war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:00:57.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}戦争は終わらせられる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:00:57.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺たちなら終わらせられる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.89,0:01:00.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But how? Don't just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.89,0:01:00.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}say that. Give me...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.89,0:01:00.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}でもどうやって？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.27,0:01:02.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}if you were the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.27,0:01:02.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}presidential candidate,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.27,0:01:02.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}言うだけじゃなくてさ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.27,0:01:02.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}大統領候補として
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:04.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}what would you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:04.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}How would you end it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:04.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}どう終わらせるか
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:04.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}言ってくれよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:04.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You know, the biggest thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:04.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}一番大事なのは
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I can see things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}I live 20 years ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺には先が見えるってこと
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}20年先を生きてるんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.83,0:01:07.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Everything I do is like something
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.83,0:01:07.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}俺のやることは全部
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.95,0:01:10.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}someone would do 20
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.95,0:01:10.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}years ahead, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.95,0:01:10.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}20年先の人間のやることなんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:14.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So it's laying out the plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:14.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}the same way how I lay out...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:14.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}だから計画を描くんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:14.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺が描いてきたように
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:16.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I laid out the blueprint for Blueprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:16.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}『The Blueprint』の
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:16.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}設計図を描いたのは俺だ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.69,0:01:17.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But you got to give us a layman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.69,0:01:17.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}でも素人にもわかるように
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:19.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You're going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:19.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}speaking to constituents
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:19.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}言ってくれよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:19.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}何もわかってない有権者に
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.80,0:01:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}that don't understand anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.80,0:01:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}話すことになるんだから
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.13,0:01:22.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Here's the rap language.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.13,0:01:22.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}じゃあラップの言葉で言う
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.60,0:01:25.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I made the blueprint for Blueprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.60,0:01:25.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}『The Blueprint』の設計図を
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.60,0:01:25.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}描いたのは俺だ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.69,0:01:30.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I made the blueprint for
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.69,0:01:30.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Blueprint as a vessel of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.69,0:01:30.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}神の器として　『The Blueprint』の
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.69,0:01:30.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}設計図を描いたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.66,0:01:33.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Now, I mean, God is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.66,0:01:33.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}actually the only artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.66,0:01:33.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}つまり　本当のアーティストは
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.66,0:01:33.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}神だけなんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.31,0:01:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}This is the thing. God runs the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.31,0:01:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}そういうことだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.31,0:01:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}世界を動かしてるのは神だ
